# Consumer package / release archive boundary.
#
# The release is a consumer product, not a copy of the GitHub repository.
# Keep production source, package metadata, the licence/changelog, README, and
# concise user-facing documentation. Repository coordination, engineering
# history, research/evidence, tests, CI and local tooling stay out.

/.gitattributes export-ignore
/.gitignore export-ignore
/.github export-ignore
/AGENTS.md export-ignore
/CONTRIBUTING.md export-ignore
/DESIGN_PRINCIPLES.md export-ignore
/ROADMAP.md export-ignore
/RESEARCH.md export-ignore
/dscanner.ini export-ignore

/docs/RESEARCH_DOCUMENTS.md export-ignore
/docs/adr export-ignore
/docs/pages-publication.md export-ignore
/docs/research export-ignore
/docs/spec export-ignore

/experiments export-ignore
/tests export-ignore
